cloudsync (macOS .dylib, Linux/Android .so, Windows .dll, Apple xcframework)
  Project:   sqlite-sync by SQLiteAI  https://github.com/sqliteai/sqlite-sync
  Version:   1.2.0 (built from commit 285a1390c92fce3a1dc6f98daef213f882a5b23b,
             as recorded in ../scripts/rebuild-*.sh)
